          <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:1rem;max-width:600px;margin:0 auto;">Conheça nossas soluções completas para cada segmento do agronegócio.</p>
        </div>
        <div style="display:grid;gap:1.5rem;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(340px,1fr));">
          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:all 0.3s ease;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'">
            <img src="/cat-agro.webp" alt="Irrigação solar" style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;" />
            <div style="padding:1.5rem;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Sistemas de Irrigação</h3>
              <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;">Bomba solar para irrigação por pivô central, gotejamento e aspersão. Reduza custos com diesel em até 80%.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:all 0.3s ease;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'">
            <img src="/servico-comercial.webp" alt="Frigoríficos" style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;" />
            <div style="padding:1.5rem;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Frigoríficos e Indústria de Alimentos</h3>
              <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;">Sistemas de grande porte para refrigeração, câmaras frias e processamento.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
