          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:all 0.3s ease;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'">
            <img src="/hero-solar.webp" alt="Pomares" style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;" />
            <div style="padding:1.5rem;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Pomares e Cafezais</h3>
              <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;">Energia para bombas de irrigação, cercas elétricas e beneficiamento.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:all 0.3s ease;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'">
            <img src="/sobre-solar.webp" alt="Pecuária" style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;" />
            <div style="padding:1.5rem;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Pecuária</h3>
              <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;">Energia para ordenha mecânica, refrigeração de leITE, aquecimento de água e cercas elétricas.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);transition:all 0.3s ease;border:1px solid #f3f4f6;" onmouseover="this.style.transform='translateY(-4px)';this.style.boxShadow='0 12px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.12)'" onmouseout="this.style.transform='translateY(0)';this.style.boxShadow='0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.08)'">
            <img src="/cat-usina.webp" alt="Usinas no campo" style="width:100%;height:200px;object-fit:cover;" />
            <div style="padding:1.5rem;">
              <h3 style="font-size:1.15rem;font-weight:700;color:#111;margin-bottom:0.5rem;">Usinas no Campo</h3>
              <p style="color:#6b7280;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.6;">Aproveite áreas ociosas para gerar energia e vender o excedente no mercado livre.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
